.SH ENVIRONMENT
.SS NCURSES_TRACE
A positive integral value stored in this variable causes the following
functions to enable the tracing feature as if
.B \%curses_trace
were called.
.PP
.dS
.RS 4
\fB\%filter\fP,
\fB\%initscr\fP,
\fB\%new_prescr\fP,
\fB\%newterm\fP,
\fB\%nofilter\fP,
\fB\%restartterm\fP,
\fB\%ripoffline\fP,
\fB\%setupterm\fP,
\fB\%slk_init\fP,
\fB\%tgetent\fP,
\fB\%use_env\fP,
\fB\%use_extended_names\fP,
\fB\%use_tioctl\fP
.RE
.dE
